    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is being devoured by the overwhelming resentment of gamblers...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desperate cries of ruined addicts, corrupted dealers, and greedy phantoms have coalesced into a malevolent force, eroding every inch of the land. Yet, amidst the chaos, surviving heroes rise up\u2014and you join their ranks. Build up unique decks and battle with cards to wage an endless war against this corrupting evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey by selecting a leader from the four tribes\u2014<strong>\u2665\ufe0f Hearts, \u2660\ufe0f Spades, \u2666\ufe0f Diamonds, or \u2663\ufe0f Clubs</strong>. Recruit heroes, uncover pets hiding in ancient relics to forge powerful partnerships, and get ancestral treasures from mystics to turn the tide of battle. Meet the enigmatic masked man to enhance your card combinations or empower your deck. Every choice shapes a stronger, more unique arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/31e76ccefdaeb72dafa90e42f9eead8f.poster.avif?t=1749451069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/31e76ccefdaeb72dafa90e42f9eead8f.webm?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/31e76ccefdaeb72dafa90e42f9eead8f.mp4?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Game\u2014Break the Curse!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight darkness with the gamblers\u2019 own twisted magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items and poker hands (<strong>Pairs, Straights, Flushes, Full Houses</strong>) to build <strong>Morale</strong> for your heroes. In this unique turn-based system, you play cards <strong>once per turn</strong>, but your heroes act <strong>multiple times</strong>. The stronger your hand, the higher your score\u2014igniting Morale to trigger devastating multi-attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Positioning Is Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline heroes gain Morale first\u2014but face the deadliest blows. Will you have the Shieldbearer shatter foes with counterblows, or let the Crimson Surgeon weave a web of regeneration in the vanguard? Adapt your formation mid-battle: one decisive swap could rewrite fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the Deck That Will Save the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit heroes of unmatched skill, pair them with pets to amplify their power, and wield treasures that defy the rules of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/b9dbf73925ba39075d72a94b881f0ec4.poster.avif?t=1749451069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/b9dbf73925ba39075d72a94b881f0ec4.webm?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/b9dbf73925ba39075d72a94b881f0ec4.mp4?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single hero can bond with three pets\u2014will you stack poisons with the Plague Queen and venomous pets, or grant your tank infinite sustain with healing companions? There are no guaranteed winning formulas\u2014only endless paths to break the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/c9e3bb6b2879c66557a684384b3e0c82.poster.avif?t=1749451069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/c9e3bb6b2879c66557a684384b3e0c82.webm?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/c9e3bb6b2879c66557a684384b3e0c82.mp4?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The corruption spreads. Play your hand.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong> and face the ultimate card duel that will decide the fate of the world.</h2>",
