 this unique turn-based system, you play cards <strong>once per turn</strong>, but your heroes act <strong>multiple times</strong>. The stronger your hand, the higher your score\u2014igniting Morale to trigger devastating multi-attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Positioning Is Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline heroes gain Morale first\u2014but face the deadliest blows. Will you have the Shieldbearer shatter foes with counterblows, or let the Crimson Surgeon weave a web of regeneration in the vanguard? Adapt your formation mid-battle: one decisive swap could rewrite fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the Deck That Will Save the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit heroes of unmatched skill, pair them with pets to amplify their power, and wield treasures that defy the rules of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/b9dbf73925ba39075d72a94b881f0ec4.poster.avif?t=1749451069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/b9dbf73925ba39075d72a94b881f0ec4.webm?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/b9dbf73925ba39075d72a94b881f0ec4.mp4?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single hero can bond with three pets\u2014will you stack poisons with the Plague Queen and venomous pets, or grant your tank infinite sustain with healing companions? There are no guaranteed winning formulas\u2014only endless paths to break the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/c9e3bb6b2879c66557a684384b3e0c82.poster.avif?t=1749451069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/c9e3bb6b2879c66557a684384b3e0c82.webm?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/c9e3bb6b2879c66557a684384b3e0c82.mp4?t=1749451069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The corruption spreads. Play your hand.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong> and face the ultimate card duel that will decide the fate of the world.</h2>",
